<decision #add-mode-aware-halfcode-nodeview-shell.dual-lifecycle {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
}
(
  <question ?>同步 document token 与异步 mode lease 如何组合？</?>
  <answer { } (
    <decision-text ?>NodeView host 独立捕获两个 authority；迟到的 mode lease 若 mount 已销毁则立即 unregister。</?>
    <rationale ?>两个 registry 有不同 owner 和时序，混成单 token 会泄漏 authority 并制造半注册。</?>
    <evidence ?>统一 lifecycle tests 覆盖 mount、late completion、unmount 与 host dispose。</?>
  )>
)>
